Sun Oct 18 05:59:09 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>

- Update to version 3.5.1:
  * Faster SSIM: separable 5-tap blur with fused multiply,
    unrolled 3-channel combine and parallel cross-blur
  * Deterministic ssim_maps ordering and score accumulation
  * Improved async error handling in the CLI
  * Fixed build under --no-default-features
  * New optional cargo features for MozJPEG/WebP/AVIF input
    (not enabled in this build)
  * Upstream publishes 3.5.1 to crates.io only (no git tag), so
    switch Source to the crates.io tarball
  * CVE-2023-4863 (boo#1215349): dssim is not affected, WebP
    support is an opt-in cargo feature this package does not
    enable, so no libwebp code is linked into the binary
- Re-derive the License tag from the re-vendored dependency
  tree (AGPL-3.0-only AND Apache-2.0 AND BSD-3-Clause AND MIT
  AND Zlib)
- Spec cleanup: drop the Group tag, require rust >= 1.90 per
  upstream rust-version, neutralize upstream strip=true so
  debuginfo packages keep working

